<title>USA: Aerosonic Corp Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Aerosonic Corp Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							    April 30,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				 $ 5,327,000    $ 4,661,000</p>
<p> Income (Loss) Before Taxes		425,000	(301,000)</p>
<p>Benefit (Provision) For Income Taxes</p>
<p>						 (147,000)	  102,000</p>
<p> Net Income/(Loss)			   278,000	(199,000)</p>
